                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A surprisingly enjoyable experience. I didn't expect much from a low poly game, but I grew quite attached to Anling and Cody. It's a little rough around the edges, but the bread and butter of this game is good and the story is pretty good too. The only thing negative I'll say, is that you can absolutely mess up your run. I didn't fully understand the deadline, and I spent too many days exploring locations. By the time the end of the game came around, I didn't have enough time to do what I needed to do. Even loading earlier saves didn't help me. So I started all over and was a lot quicker, allowing me to complete it properly. Either way, definitely recommend the game.",
